    "body": "Fix https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/actions/runs/38882212577/job/116911393791?pr=36545#step:11:3700:\n\n\n```\n2026-10-16T09:48:01.724540Z TestFramework (INFO): Test a scenario where a transaction has a mempool conflict\n2026-10-16T09:48:02.100649Z TestFramework (INFO): Test scenario where a mempool conflict is removed\n2026-10-16T10:28:02.397150Z TestFramework (ERROR): Unexpected exception:\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/home/runner/work/_temp/test/functional/test_framework/test_framework.py\", line 146, in main\n    self.run_test()\n    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^\n  File \"/home/runner/work/_temp/build_ ₿🧪_/test/functional/wallet_conflicts.py\", line 38, in run_test\n    self.test_mempool_conflict()\n    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^\n  File \"/home/runner/work/_temp/build_ ₿🧪_/test/functional/wallet_conflicts.py\", line 202, in test_mempool_conflict\n    self.generate(self.nodes[2], 1)\n    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/runner/work/_temp/test/functional/test_framework/test_framework.py\", line 668, in generate\n    sync_fun() if sync_fun else self.sync_all()\n                                ~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^\n  File \"/home/runner/work/_temp/test/functional/test_framework/test_framework.py\", line 750, in sync_all\n    self.sync_mempools(nodes)\n    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/runner/work/_temp/test/functional/test_framework/test_framework.py\", line 743, in sync_mempools\n    raise AssertionError(\"Mempool sync timed out after {}s:{}\".format(\n    ...<2 lines>...\n    ))\nAssertionError: Mempool sync timed out after 2400s:\n  {'ed4cecf5b16f82ce48b2c56b6a20feac3f83e6043b262a74f356e07a451dda34'}\n  {'47de6fdef43b22320dc0114c2104e3dee58de9591799ff5e48ff29efaa5cf88f', 'ed4cecf5b16f82ce48b2c56b6a20feac3f83e6043b262a74f356e07a451dda34'}\n  {'ed4cecf5b16f82ce48b2c56b6a20feac3f83e6043b262a74f356e07a451dda34'}\n```\n\nby adding the missing `sync_mempools`.\n",
